Package: WienerRS
Type: Package
Title: Wiener Process Degradation Models with Imperfect Maintenance Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "George Anderson",
           family = "A. dos Santos",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "george_13031995@hotmail.com")
Description: Provides tools for simulating, estimating, and analyzing 
    degradation processes modeled by Wiener processes (Brownian motion 
    with drift) under imperfect maintenance actions, restoration states, 
    and degradation reductions. Features include maximum likelihood 
    parameter estimation, Monte Carlo simulation studies, diagnostic 
    plots (P-P, Q-Q, Anderson-Darling tests), and reliability/hazard 
    merit functions.
